<body>
    <h1>Documentation d&#39;Architecture Technique : Infrastructure Hybride=
 (OneSoftware)</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrappe=
r confluence-embedded-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image =
image-center" alt=3D"Archi_Infra_Windows.png" width=3D"468" loading=3D"lazy=
" src=3D"14b1b142236336b10a939b09bba5b36349b6a8a66a6496e9d4cf1e9c96b776bd" =
data-image-src=3D"https://oneortho.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/=
2122285080/Archi_Infra_Windows.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D17696=
89250434&amp;cacheVersion=3D1&amp;api=3Dv2" data-height=3D"1332" data-width=
=3D"2452" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"21=
21302024" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"a=
ttachment" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"Archi_Infra_Windows.png" d=
ata-base-url=3D"https://oneortho.atlassian.net/wiki" data-linked-resource-c=
ontent-type=3D"image/png" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"2122285080" =
data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"3" data-media-id=3D"3ca52e03-e30d=
-4f54-bebb-7f945b584910" data-media-type=3D"file" height=3D"254"></span>
<p local-id=3D"adaec9d9b63c"></p>
<h2 local-id=3D"627ca58dc26c" id=3D"Documentationd'ArchitectureTechnique:In=
frastructureHybride(OneSoftware)-1.Vued'ensemble">1. Vue d'ensemble</h2>
<p local-id=3D"ed9c1b254ffc">L'architecture repose sur une approche hybride=
 interconnectant deux environnements distincts pour s=C3=A9parer la logique=
 m=C3=A9tier (h=C3=A9berg=C3=A9e sur Windows) des charges de calcul intensi=
ves (IA/Docker h=C3=A9berg=C3=A9es sur Linux/OVH).</p>
<ul local-id=3D"5c490821-26ea-4402-82eb-ce491cab978a">
<li local-id=3D"9c74de9c-4930-44f3-af44-3fd6acb27ee9">
<p local-id=3D"b17069f25289"><strong>Zone Principale (AVA6) :</strong> H=C3=
=A9berge le c=C5=93ur de l'application m=C3=A9tier (OneSoftware) et la base=
 de donn=C3=A9es.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4b14ba36-ec2c-469f-8e01-c2c36757dc03">
<p local-id=3D"ab40a08b20b5"><strong>Zone de Calcul (OVH) :</strong> H=C3=
=A9berge les micro-services, l'API asynchrone et les conteneurs Docker pour=
 le traitement IA.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"4d9c48a1-5806-458d-8f63-3635d8523807">
<h2 local-id=3D"5730396bfc7f" id=3D"Documentationd'ArchitectureTechnique:In=
frastructureHybride(OneSoftware)-2.Descriptiond=C3=A9taill=C3=A9edesZones">=
2. Description d=C3=A9taill=C3=A9e des Zones</h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"2b97f9371a68" id=3D"Documentationd'ArchitectureTechnique:In=
frastructureHybride(OneSoftware)-A.InfrastructureH=C3=A9berg=C3=A9e(AVA6)">=
A. Infrastructure H=C3=A9berg=C3=A9e (AVA6)</h3>
<p local-id=3D"bdf69d2dfd68">Cette zone g=C3=A8re le trafic utilisateur pri=
ncipal et la persistance des donn=C3=A9es m=C3=A9tier.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"0f30eea0-c69e-4036-97b8-41bb5cb02159">
<li local-id=3D"91a6d17f-e5de-4030-a201-625625f94ff4">
<p local-id=3D"f4af33e6a923"><strong>S=C3=A9curit=C3=A9 P=C3=A9riph=C3=A9ri=
que :</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"f99a78c6-67ed-4c49-9644-18d75a84f778">
<li local-id=3D"843c1b59-6a6e-4280-bda0-b48d194de09e">
<p local-id=3D"7a9a20f06040"><strong>Firewall AVA6 :</strong> Filtrage nive=
au 3/4 en entr=C3=A9e.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6f346f83-39d0-455b-a038-0922aae16d96">
<p local-id=3D"32a473aa9798"><strong>Reverse Proxy AVA6 :</strong> Terminai=
son SSL et routage bas=C3=A9 sur les noms de domaine (<code>prod.domain.com=
</code> vs <code>preprod.domain.com</code>).</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"a33bd10d-f4d3-431b-b4fd-43c746bd8042">
<p local-id=3D"faaddf1d8f0c"><strong>N=C5=93uds de traitement (Windows Serv=
er <span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"d0d900db-a8de-4c56-9c0=
1-06ea1a234971">2022</span>) :</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"7b55ebf2-78bc-4d17-a3a9-360924455601">
<li local-id=3D"7e51af2d-24d9-414c-9155-78ca11cb8ac3">
<p local-id=3D"5585ca4b7acb">Architecture monolithique r=C3=A9pliqu=C3=A9e =
par environnement (Prod/Preprod isol=C3=A9s).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ee5959f7-867e-4f06-820d-a8af9c4fa500">
<p local-id=3D"d1083061b3b2"><strong>Serveur Web :</strong> IIS g=C3=A8re l=
es requ=C3=AAtes HTTP et sert les assets statiques.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3def20f5-8d38-4a3b-bb12-329e4f018c41">
<p local-id=3D"60538c30413c"><strong>Couche Applicative :</strong> PHP/Symf=
ony ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9 via <strong>FastCGI</strong>. Le framework int=C3=A8g=
re nativement les modules Angular (2D/3D) via inclusion de chemins (<code>I=
nclude Path</code>), sans serveur Node.js s=C3=A9par=C3=A9.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"0d6e56f4-a7fb-49b7-bb57-8a1d690dca9f">
<p local-id=3D"cbb0aa9bfdc5"><strong>Donn=C3=A9es (Persistance) :</strong><=
/p>
<ul local-id=3D"6232fecb-c4ca-4bd7-8709-0a608d0e47a1">
<li local-id=3D"a2e6a2ba-80a9-4ed2-aa61-c3e160be9114">
<p local-id=3D"73ab21b69eef"><strong>MariaDB :</strong> Install=C3=A9e loca=
lement sur chaque n=C5=93ud Windows.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4054fd32-4366-46c5-9089-47b1a1eb4e6d">
<p local-id=3D"ec5a06f7b502"><strong>Acc=C3=A8s :</strong> Connexion strict=
e en <code>Loopback:3306</code>. La base de donn=C3=A9es <strong>n'est pas =
expos=C3=A9e</strong> sur le r=C3=A9seau, garantissant une isolation forte.=
</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"cbf5788d042a" id=3D"Documentationd'ArchitectureTechnique:In=
frastructureHybride(OneSoftware)-B.InfrastructureOVH">B. Infrastructure OVH=
</h3>
<p local-id=3D"b2af229f5257">Cette zone est d=C3=A9di=C3=A9e aux traitement=
s lourds et asynchrones, bas=C3=A9s sur des technologies conteneuris=C3=A9e=
s.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"af774de8-62d3-4eff-8070-6059ebfbb482">
<li local-id=3D"90f15f50-58c7-4805-8a71-2813f3849e76">
<p local-id=3D"e3bd1c57e990"><strong>Point d'Entr=C3=A9e :</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"6f49016c-54d8-45df-8fa3-02791f05decc">
<li local-id=3D"91b037a5-97ee-446c-b598-a23d1d6e6d3f">
<p local-id=3D"a0358aa9711c"><strong>Traefik :</strong> Agit comme Edge Rou=
ter / Load Balancer pour l'infrastructure Docker. Il re=C3=A7oit le trafic =
HTTPS direct (ex: pour les chirurgiens ou les appels API externes).</p></li=
>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"2f4a0a64-cecc-4ae3-8142-c311bf3700cf">
<p local-id=3D"507394fdfc20"><strong>Serveur Debian (Orchestration &amp; AP=
I) :</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"bdf47109-f1ef-4687-8125-69313e361ba9">
<li local-id=3D"11269955-84a9-4a08-8ec8-6c0bae97f818">
<p local-id=3D"385db59824b9">H=C3=A9berge une API Symfony l=C3=A9g=C3=A8re.=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a17458e8-7f3e-4a12-9b75-2c1cab34c8d4">
<p local-id=3D"fbf53ad35f76"><strong>Composant Messenger :</strong> G=C3=A8=
re la file d'attente (Queue) pour les t=C3=A2ches asynchrones.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"8e1c3d5e-09b3-4add-ad70-8c42e0ae138e">
<p local-id=3D"5178966009fd"><strong>Serveur Ubuntu (Worker &amp; IA) :</st=
rong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"b7259bb1-183c-4078-916f-90d9f1821ee1">
<li local-id=3D"419c5a01-9162-4ab8-bf56-628817cb39a1">
<p local-id=3D"07acd0e89cb5"><strong>Worker :</strong> Consomme les message=
s de la file d'attente.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6aaa1abb-0069-4bfd-b5b2-14f0d2572131">
<p local-id=3D"c313e09007c9"><strong>Docker IA :</strong> Le worker instanc=
ie/lance des images Docker sp=C3=A9cifiques pour le traitement IA =C3=A0 la=
 demande et d=C3=A9truie l=E2=80=99instance en fin de traitement.</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"4c56913c-cc03-49b1-b49a-690f397059d6">
<p local-id=3D"23221aebba18"><strong>R=C3=A9seau Partag=C3=A9 :</strong> Le=
s serveurs Debian et Ubuntu communiquent via un r=C3=A9seau priv=C3=A9 virt=
uel pour s=C3=A9curiser les =C3=A9changes API/Worker.</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"7e2c138e-c84f-49b2-aaee-90b419443fd4">
<h2 local-id=3D"648de3d63feb" id=3D"Documentationd'ArchitectureTechnique:In=
frastructureHybride(OneSoftware)-3.MatricedesFlux(Flows)">3. Matrice des Fl=
ux (Flows)</h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"07=
7ccba0-54e8-4aa8-aa2c-710ad04c7141" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0a7f17f7-a24f-46c6-970d-4fdaac742477">
<td data-local-id=3D"ae915313-886e-48f6-8ee1-39cd4a64da1f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5b951f2025e1"><strong>Source</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"309cf139-d401-48fc-a9af-4cea90409c97" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8d88f96e7e9f"><strong>Destination</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"956466f7-9e2c-49f3-a853-8e7cee1dca04" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"275b78adff4b"><strong>Protocole / Port</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"935461b8-cb9d-4b08-853a-cbd938150ecf" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"79ea8131c5bd"><strong>Description</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8f5a05de-9b5f-4a67-96c3-cabd99505928">
<td data-local-id=3D"017a07c1-7256-44b7-8604-e996511c34d5" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"18874c19e48e"><strong>Internet (Client)</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e347ae67-4a8b-48ba-8004-191e981bd5dd" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9be1b4b51400"><strong>Firewall AVA6</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"36f095c6-d7f0-4c3d-9ecb-cdac8d6df9dd" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d83e332ccb97">HTTPS / 443</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"73b44287-18e9-48f5-9919-7009af32de49" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f482363cbfc2">Acc=C3=A8s utilisateur =C3=A0 l'application pr=
incipale.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1aae4dd7-6bb4-49e4-8fc4-b7e1b91d3a7d">
<td data-local-id=3D"0561cdf8-4c46-4b1d-a40c-8ad531ecfde4" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"aa66ff0b3c84"><strong>Internet (Client)</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"142ea8cc-7649-4da7-a232-2b6ff103f3c2" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f73780a180b3"><strong>Traefik (OVH)</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"0bfdee3d-8c23-40ae-bf6c-8b73ad4c57a7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1fbe4e60fd9c">HTTPS / 443</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b299b7f6-a5e3-455d-a76f-312a9aa1d366" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c1b6870afec4">Acc=C3=A8s direct aux services IA/API (si appl=
icable).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0e3e1265-d231-46c0-9974-5813677c4a08">
<td data-local-id=3D"6cace9f2-d6ef-4a04-bf99-b8519c168e1f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"eab8f9e230c5"><strong>Reverse Proxy AVA6</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"160ccc44-eebc-444c-a7bf-ab1ff85671f9" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c97da48ce32d"><strong>IIS (Windows)</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dd49c615-e479-4e90-b5f5-305f5747299c" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"de96c8f8508b">HTTP(S) / Standard</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e8248831-4a5d-4882-9ade-0fd5d1a9223a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d9adc994995e">Routage du trafic vers le serveur appropri=C3=
=A9 (Prod/Preprod).</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"0ea69d0d-d630-4b6f-b5ab-4360e4bf9e7c">
<td data-local-id=3D"a8760936-f795-4a01-b5bc-262c288231a9" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"67134e4c93af"><strong>Symfony (Windows)</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"e383313b-aad1-41fe-ac10-55d5967a0f36" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"969289e4456a"><strong>Traefik (OVH)</strong></p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c09c174c-f38d-4d8c-80c2-5d3ebc6a69f1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d9cabb72fa93">HTTPS / 443</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7c7efd8b-a453-429e-9224-dda5e45f051a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"efde97545f4a"><strong>Flux critique :</strong> L'app m=C3=A9=
tier demande un traitement IA via appel API externe.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"bcae2a29-8ac0-4bff-9819-fccd4f2ec7e7">
